1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:09,070
This module is for students, and for staff who help them. The student needs their enrollment number and the activation code from the school.

2
00:00:11,953 --> 00:00:16,203
On the school's sign-in page, click Activate your student account.

3
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:21,797
Enter the enrollment number and the activation code exactly as printed.

4
00:00:23,026 --> 00:00:27,551
Choose a password of at least ten characters and type it again to confirm.

5
00:00:28,855 --> 00:00:34,539
Click Activate and sign in. The code now stops working, so nobody else can use it.

6
00:00:37,926 --> 00:00:44,893
Aarav is now in his student portal. There are no results yet. They will appear here when the school publishes them.

7
00:00:47,169 --> 00:00:55,520
To sign out, open the account menu and click Sign out. Next time, Aarav signs in with his enrollment number and password.

8
00:00:57,450 --> 00:01:01,429
Next, we create the examination: Periodic Test 1.
